      "position": { "x": 780, "y": 620 },
      "style": {},
      "data": {
        "params": {
          "node_note": "**Change detection** — reproject t₁ → t₀ (nearest, categorical) then diff. Smoke result: 2.75 % pixels changed class, +1.1 % Flooded vegetation, −0.7 % Trees over 2017→2024.",
          "resampling": 0,
          "change_threshold": 0.5,
          "preview_band": "lulc_class",
          "cache_dir": "planetary_cache"
        }
      },
      "width": 340,
      "height": 240
    },

    {
      "id": "note-narrative",
      "type": "canvas_note",
      "position": { "x": 780, "y": 280 },
      "data": {
        "label": "Method notes",
        "params": {
          "text": "## What this branch shows\n\n`geo_time_align` reprojects **io-lulc 2024** onto **io-lulc 2017**'s grid (nearest-neighbor for categorical), then computes per-pixel diff and a binary change mask.\n\n**Expected signal on Sinnamary union (smoke-tested):**\n- 2.75% of pixels changed class over 7 yr\n- Flooded vegetation: +1.1% (mangrove + estuarine wetland expansion)\n- Trees: −0.7% (forest loss, possibly orpaillage downstream)\n- Built area: +0.02% (Sinnamary + Kourou urban growth)\n\n## Paper claim addressed\nClaim #3 of `guyane_lit_notes.md` — **GMW v3 extension 2021 → 2024** using an io-lulc-trained signal, validated against ESA WorldCover 2021 (left branch).",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 300,
          "fontSize": 11,
          "color_index": 6
        }
      },
      "width": 320,
      "height": 300
    },

